{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.52,
   "text": "you're getting a 20% raise in your income,"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.82,
   "end": 4.34,
   "text": "but when I looked at the cost of living,"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.38,
   "end": 5.94,
   "text": "it was actually a 40% decrease."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.1,
   "end": 9.26,
   "text": "I'm like, I can't even afford to go get my own apartment."
  },
  {
   "start": 9.78,
   "end": 11.7,
   "text": "And so I delayed gratification, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.16,
   "end": 15.82,
   "text": "And I said, hey, I only wanna have 25% of what I'm making"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.82,
   "end": 19.44,
   "text": "on base, not commission, go toward living expenses, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 19.88,
   "end": 21.54,
   "text": "And so I ended up doing a house hack,"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.74,
   "end": 23.18,
   "text": "but not in the traditional sense."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.26,
   "end": 24.02,
   "text": "I didn't buy anything."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.3,
   "end": 26.14,
   "text": "I just had two roommates in an apartment"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.14,
   "end": 28.08,
   "text": "and we all rented it together, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.08,
   "end": 30.76,
   "text": "And I was able to save significantly on that front."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.98,
   "end": 31.96,
   "text": "You did a rental house hack."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.1,
   "end": 32.68,
   "text": "I did that too."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.22,
   "end": 33.64,
   "text": "Did you?"
  },
  {
   "start": 33.88,
   "end": 35.52,
   "text": "Yeah, not because I was in the real estate,"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.66,
   "end": 36.08,
   "text": "I was just broke."
  }
 ],
